\ The calling half of aot_inline_error_frames_nested_image.
\
\ The call to `leaf` sits inside a quotation literal, so the run expansion writes covers that
\ quotation's own rebuilt body rather than this word's array. In a runtime-image binary the body is
\ bytecode the loader decoded, which has no name and no row of its own, so the run reaches it only
\ through the instruction path the image carries alongside it.

use "aot_inline_error_frames_nested_image_lib.1z" ;

outer: ( s v -- n ) [ [ leaf ] call 0 + ] ;
